msgid ""
"Accrual entries are adjusting journal entries made at the end of an "
"accounting period to ensure that revenues/expenses are recognized in the "
"period in which they are earned/incurred, regardless of when cash is "
"received / paid."
msgstr ""
"Jaksotuskirjaukset ovat laskentakauden lopussa tehtäviä oikaisukirjauksia, "
