"report, as described in :ref:`inventory/operations_valuation/adjust-"
"valuation`. It also includes an :guilabel:`Aging Report` favorite for "
"tracking remaining quantity and value by month."
msgstr ""
"Raportti :doc:`../warehouses_storage/reporting/moves_analysis` luettelee "
"siirrot lähdesijainteineen, kohdesijainteineen, määrineen ja arvoineen sekä "
"vielä varastossa olevan :guilabel:`Jäljellä olevan määrän` "
