#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/inventory_valuation/valuation_by_lots.rst:26
msgid ""
"On the product form, in the :guilabel:`Category` field, choose a product "
"category. Ensure the product category's :guilabel:`Costing Method` is set to "
"*First In First Out (FIFO)* or *Average Cost (AVCO)*."
msgstr ""
"Valitse tuotelomakkeella :guilabel:`Luokka`-kentässä tuoteluokka. Varmista, "
