msgstr ":guilabel:`kohdesijainti`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/picking_methods/batch.rst:155
msgid ""
"The Batch and Wave Transfers settings page with the Auto batch grouping "
