msgstr ""
"Erä- ja aaltosiirtojen asetussivu, jossa automaattisen eräryhmittelyn "
"kriteerit näkyvät."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/picking_methods/batch.rst:159
msgid "Process batch transfer"
msgstr "Käsittele eräsiirto"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/picking_methods/batch.rst:161
msgid ""
"Handle batch transfers in the :menuselection:`Inventory app --> Operations --"
"> Batch Transfers` page."
msgstr ""
"Käsittele eräsiirtoja sivulla :menuselection:`Varastointi --> Toiminnot --> "
"Eräsiirrot`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/picking_methods/batch.rst:165
msgid ""
"Be certain the batch transfer is complete when the :guilabel:`Validate` "
"button is highlighted in purple. If the :guilabel:`Reserve` button is "
"highlighted instead, that means there are items in the batch that are "
"currently *not* available in-stock."
msgstr ""
"Eräsiirto on varmasti valmis, kun painike :guilabel:`Vahvista` on korostettu "
"violetilla. Jos sen sijaan korostettuna on painike :guilabel:`Varaa`, erässä "
"on tuotteita, joita *ei* tällä hetkellä ole saatavilla varastossa."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/picking_methods/batch.rst:169
msgid ""
"To view the complete product list, select the desired batch transfer. In the "
"*Operations* tab, the :guilabel:`Quantity` column indicates the required "
"quantity for the order. The :guilabel:`Reserved` column shows the available "
"stock to fulfill the order. Lastly, the :guilabel:`Picked` column specifies "
"the products that have been picked and are ready for the next step."
msgstr ""
"Tarkastele täydellistä tuoteluetteloa valitsemalla haluamasi eräsiirto. "
