"pitäisi lisätä. Klikkaa sitten :guilabel:`Lisää aaltoon`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/picking_methods/wave.rst:71
msgid "Select lines to add to the wave."
msgstr "Valitse rivit, jotka lisätään aaltoon."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/picking_methods/wave.rst:75
msgid ""
"Use the :guilabel:`Filters` in the search bar to group lines with the same "
