#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/removal_strategies/fefo.rst:148
msgid ""
"Using the :abbr:`FEFO (First Expired, First Out)` removal strategy ensures "
"that products with the nearest removal date are picked first."
msgstr ""
":abbr:`FEFO (First Expired, First Out)` -poistostrategian käyttö varmistaa, "
"että tuotteet, joiden poistopäivä on lähinnä, kerätään ensin."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/removal_strategies/fefo.rst:151
msgid ""
"To understand how this removal strategy works, consider the following "
