"Poista tarvittaessa tämä ryhmittely ja ryhmittele tuotteen mukaan."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/removal_strategies/fifo.rst:90
msgid ""
"Then, select the :icon:`fa-caret-right` :guilabel:`(right-pointing arrow)` "
