"kohtaan :menuselection:`Varastointi-sovellus --> Asetukset --> Varastot` ja "
"valitse haluttu varasto."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/third_party_shipper.rst:191
msgid ""
"On the warehouse configuration page, open the warehouse contact page by "
"clicking the :guilabel:`Company` field."
msgstr ""
"Avaa varastoasetussivulla varaston yhteystietosivu "
"napsauttamalla :guilabel:`Yritys`-kenttää."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/third_party_shipper.rst:194
msgid "Highlight the \"Company\" field."
msgstr "Korosta \"Yritys\"-kenttä."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/third_party_shipper.rst:198
msgid ""
"Verify that the :guilabel:`Address` and :guilabel:`Phone` number are "
"correct, as they are required for the shipping connector to work properly."
msgstr ""
"Tarkista, että :guilabel:`Osoite` ja :guilabel:`Puhelin`numero ovat oikein, "
"koska ne vaaditaan, jotta toimitusliitin toimii kunnolla."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/third_party_shipper.rst:201
msgid "Show company address and phone number."
msgstr "Näytä yrityksen osoite ja puhelinnumero."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/third_party_shipper.rst:208
msgid "Product weight"
msgstr "Tuotteen paino"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/third_party_shipper.rst:210
msgid ""
"For the carrier integration to work properly, specify the weight of products "
"by going to :menuselection:`Inventory app --> Products --> Products`, and "
"selecting the desired product."
msgstr ""
"Jotta kuljetusyhtiöintegraatio toimii oikein, määritä tuotteiden paino "
"siirtymällä kohtaan :menuselection:`Varastointi-sovellus --> Tuotteet --> "
