msgstr "Käytä kolmannen osapuolen kuljetusyhtiötä"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/third_party_shipper.rst:225
msgid ""
"Shipping carriers can be applied on a :abbr:`SO (Sales Order)`, invoice, or "
"delivery order."
msgstr ""
"Kuljetusyhtiöitä voidaan käyttää :abbr:`MT:ssä (myyntitilauksessa)`, "
"laskussa tai toimitustilauksessa."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/third_party_shipper.rst:227
msgid ""
"After configuring the third-party carrier's :ref:`delivery method <inventory/"
"shipping_receiving/configure-delivery-method>` in Odoo, create or navigate "
"to a quotation by going to :menuselection:`Sales app --> Orders --> "
