"valitsemalla haluttu varastopaikka."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/inventory_management/use_locations.rst:119
msgid ""
"In the location form, access each of these options by selecting its "
"corresponding smart button."
msgstr ""
"Voit käyttää kutakin näistä vaihtoehdoista sijaintilomakkeessa valitsemalla "
"sitä vastaavan älypainikkeen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/inventory_management/use_locations.rst:124
msgid "View putaway rules"
msgstr "Tarkastele hyllytyssääntöjä"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/inventory_management/use_locations.rst:126
msgid ""
"To view all putaway rules for the location, click the :icon:`fa-"
"random` :guilabel:`Putaway Rules` smart button. This opens the :doc:`Putaway "
"Rules <../../shipping_receiving/daily_operations/putaway>` page, where users "
"can view, edit, or create additional rules."
msgstr ""
"Jos haluat tarkastella kaikkia varastopaikan hyllytyssääntöjä, napsauta "
":icon:`fa-random` :guilabel:`Hyllytyssäännöt` -älypainiketta. Tämä avaa "
"sivun :doc:`Hyllytyssäännöt <../../shipping_receiving/daily_operations/"
"putaway>`, jossa käyttäjät voivat tarkastella, muokata tai luoda lisää "
"sääntöjä."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/inventory_management/use_locations.rst:134
msgid "View products"
msgstr "Tarkastele tuotteita"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/inventory_management/use_locations.rst:136
msgid ""
"To view all products at the location, click the :icon:`fa-th-"
"list` :guilabel:`Products` smart button. By default, this opens a list of "
"all available products or products with outstanding demand. Additional "
"filters and grouping options can be applied via the search bar."
msgstr ""
"Jos haluat nähdä kaikki sijainnin tuotteet, napsauta :icon:`fa-th-"
"list` :guilabel:`Tuotteet` -älypainiketta. Oletusarvoisesti tämä avaa "
"luettelon kaikista saatavilla olevista tuotteista tai tuotteista, joilla on "
"avointa kysyntää. Hakupalkin kautta voidaan käyttää muita suodatin- ja "
"ryhmittelyvaihtoehtoja."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/inventory_management/warehouses.rst:5
msgid ""
"In the Odoo *Inventory* app, a *warehouse* is a physical space with an "
"address for storing items, such as a storage facility, distribution center, "
"or physical store."
msgstr ""
"Odoon *Varastointi*-sovelluksessa *varasto* on fyysinen tila, jolla on "
"osoite tuotteiden varastointia varten, kuten varastotila, jakelukeskus tai "
"fyysinen myymälä."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/inventory_management/warehouses.rst:8
msgid ""
"Each database has a preconfigured warehouse with the company's address. "
"Users can set up multiple warehouses, and :doc:`create stock moves <../../"
"shipping_receiving/daily_operations/use_routes>` between them."
msgstr ""
"Jokaisessa tietokannassa on esimääritetty varasto yrityksen osoitteella. "
"Käyttäjät voivat määrittää useita varastoja ja :doc:`luoda varastosiirtoja "
"<../../shipping_receiving/daily_operations/use_routes>` niiden välille."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/inventory_management/warehouses.rst:17
msgid ""
"To create or manage warehouses, go to :menuselection:`Inventory app --> "
"Configuration --> Warehouses`."
msgstr ""
"Voit luoda tai hallita varastoja siirtymällä "
"kohtaan :menuselection:`Varastointi-sovellus --> Asetukset --> Varastot`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/inventory_management/warehouses.rst:20
msgid ""
"Then, select an existing warehouse, or create a new one by "
"clicking :guilabel:`New`. Doing so opens the warehouse form, which contains "
"the following fields:"
msgstr ""
"Valitse sitten olemassa oleva varasto tai luo uusi "
"napsauttamalla :guilabel:`Uusi`. Tämä avaa varastolomakkeen, joka sisältää "
"seuraavat kentät:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/inventory_management/warehouses.rst:23
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Warehouse` (*required field*): the full name of the warehouse."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Varasto` (*pakollinen kenttä*): varaston koko nimi."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/inventory_management/warehouses.rst:24
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Short Name` (*required field*): the abbreviated code for the "
"warehouse (maximum five characters). The short name for the default "
"warehouse in Odoo is `WH`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Lyhyt nimi` (*pakollinen kenttä*): varaston lyhennetty koodi "
"(enintään viisi merkkiä). Odoon oletusvaraston lyhyt nimi on `WH`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/inventory_management/warehouses.rst:28
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Short Name` appears on warehouse documents, so it is "
"recommended to use a memorable one, like \"WH[first letters of location]\" "
"(e.g. `WHA`, `WHB`, etc.)."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Lyhyt nimi` näkyy varastoasiakirjoissa, joten on suositeltavaa "
"käyttää helposti muistettavaa nimeä, kuten \"WH[sijainnin ensimmäiset "
"kirjaimet]\" (esim. `WHA`, `WHB` jne.)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/inventory_management/warehouses.rst:31
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Address` (*required field*): the address of the warehouse. To "
"change the warehouse address when creating two or more warehouses, hover "
"over the field, and click the :icon:`fa-arrow-right` :guilabel:`(right "
"arrow)`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Osoite` (*pakollinen kenttä*): varaston osoite. Voit vaihtaa "
"varaston osoitetta luodessasi kaksi tai useampia varastoja viemällä hiiren "
"kentän päälle ja napsauttamalla :icon:`fa-arrow-right` :guilabel:`(oikea "
"nuoli)`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/inventory_management/warehouses.rst:34
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Company` (*required field*): the company that owns the warehouse; "
"this can be set as the company that owns the Odoo database, or the company "
"of a customer or vendor."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Yritys` (*pakollinen kenttä*): varaston omistava yritys; tämä voi "
"olla Odoo-tietokannan omistava yritys tai asiakkaan tai toimittajan yritys."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/inventory_management/warehouses.rst:36
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Intrastat region`: :doc:`region name <../../../../finance/"
"accounting/reporting/intrastat>` required for companies in the European "
"Union."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Intrastat-alue`: Euroopan unionin yrityksiltä "
"vaadittava :doc:`alueen nimi <../../../../finance/accounting/reporting/"
"intrastat>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/inventory_management/warehouses.rst:41
msgid ""
"The options below are available **only** when the *Multi-Step Routes* "
"feature is enabled in :menuselection:`Inventory app --> Configuration --> "
"Settings`."
msgstr ""
"Alla olevat vaihtoehdot ovat käytettävissä **vain**, kun *Monivaiheisten "
"reittien* ominaisuus on käytössä kohdassa :menuselection:`Varastointi-"
"sovellus --> Asetukset --> Asetukset`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/inventory_management/warehouses.rst:44
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Incoming Shipments`: select the option to receive products from "
"the warehouse in :doc:`one <../../shipping_receiving/daily_operations/"
"receipts_delivery_one_step>`, :doc:`two <../../shipping_receiving/"
"daily_operations/receipts_delivery_two_steps>`, or :doc:`three <../../"
"shipping_receiving/daily_operations/receipts_three_steps>` steps."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Saapuvat lähetykset`: valitse vaihtoehto tuotteiden "
"vastaanottamiseksi varastosta :doc:`yhdessä <../../shipping_receiving/"
"daily_operations/receipts_delivery_one_step>`, :doc:`kahdessa <../../"
"shipping_receiving/daily_operations/receipts_delivery_two_steps>` "
"tai :doc:`kolmessa <../../shipping_receiving/daily_operations/"
"receipts_three_steps>` vaiheessa."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/inventory_management/warehouses.rst:49
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Outgoing Shipments`: select the option to deliver products from "
"the warehouse in :doc:`one <../../shipping_receiving/daily_operations/"
"receipts_delivery_one_step>`, :doc:`two <../../shipping_receiving/"
"daily_operations/receipts_delivery_two_steps>`, or :doc:`three <../../"
"shipping_receiving/daily_operations/delivery_three_steps>` steps."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Lähtevät lähetykset`: valitse vaihtoehto tuotteiden "
"toimittamiseksi varastosta :doc:`yhdessä <../../shipping_receiving/"
"daily_operations/receipts_delivery_one_step>`, :doc:`kahdessa <../../"
"shipping_receiving/daily_operations/receipts_delivery_two_steps>` "
"tai :doc:`kolmessa <../../shipping_receiving/daily_operations/"
"delivery_three_steps>` vaiheessa."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/inventory_management/warehouses.rst:54
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Dropship Subcontractors`: available with the *Subcontracting* "
"feature enabled in :menuselection:`Manufacturing app --> Configuration --> "
"Settings`. Tick this checkbox to purchase components from vendors, and "
"dropship them to subcontractors."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Suoratoimitukset alihankkijoille`: käytettävissä, kun "
