"sovellus --> Asetukset --> Asetukset`. Valitse tämä valintaruutu ostaaksesi "
"komponentteja toimittajilta ja suoratoimituksella ne alihankkijoille."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/inventory_management/warehouses.rst:57
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Resupply Subcontractors`: available with the *Subcontracting* "
"feature, tick this checkbox to supply subcontractors with raw materials "
"stored in *this* specific warehouse."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Täydennys alihankkijoille`: käytettävissä *Alihankinta*-"
"ominaisuudella, valitse tämä valintaruutu toimittaaksesi alihankkijoille "
"raaka-aineita, jotka on varastoitu *tässä* tietyssä varastossa."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/inventory_management/warehouses.rst:59
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Manufacture to Resupply`: tick this checkbox to allow for items "
"to be manufactured in this warehouse."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Manufacture to Resupply`: valitse tämä valintaruutu, jotta "
"tuotteita voidaan valmistaa tässä varastossa."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/inventory_management/warehouses.rst:61
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Manufacture`: choose whether to manufacture products in :doc:`one "
"<../../../manufacturing/basic_setup/one_step_manufacturing>`, :doc:`two "
"<../../../manufacturing/basic_setup/two_step_manufacturing>`, or :doc:`three "
"steps <../../../manufacturing/basic_setup/three_step_manufacturing>`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Manufacture`: valitse, valmistetaanko tuotteet :doc:`yhdessä "
"<../../../manufacturing/basic_setup/one_step_manufacturing>`, :doc:`kahdessa "
"<../../../manufacturing/basic_setup/two_step_manufacturing>` "
"vai :doc:`kolmessa vaiheessa <../../../manufacturing/basic_setup/"
"three_step_manufacturing>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/inventory_management/warehouses.rst:65
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Buy to Resupply`: tick this checkbox to allow for purchased "
"products to be delivered to the warehouse."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Buy to Resupply`: valitse tämä valintaruutu, jotta ostettuja "
"tuotteita voidaan toimittaa varastoon."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/inventory_management/warehouses.rst:67
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Resupply From`: available with multiple warehouses in the "
