#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/reporting/moves_analysis.rst:62
msgid ":guilabel:`Product`: Group records by product."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Tuote`: ryhmittele tietueet tuotteen mukaan."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/reporting/moves_analysis.rst:63
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Operation Type`: Group records by operation type, "
